msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ArtifactOperationReceipt|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Artifact Operation Receipt"
msgstr "Activité consignée sur artefact"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ArtifactOperationReceipt|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An artifact-operation activity occurrence retained as a receipt of what happened. It is an Activity subordinate to its attempt or ToolCall, not an information document masquerading as an event."
msgstr "Occurrence d’activité sur artefact conservée comme compte rendu de ce qui s’est passé. C’est une Activity subordonnée à sa tentative ou ToolCall, pas un document informationnel pris pour un événement."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ArtifactOperationReceipt|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for a recorded creation, read or update operation within an attempt or tool call."
msgstr "Utiliser pour une opération enregistrée de création, lecture ou mise à jour dans une tentative ou un appel d’outil."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ArtifactOperationReceipt|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating its result digest as the artifact’s own byte identity or as success."
msgstr "Éviter de traiter son empreinte de résultat comme l’identité des octets de l’artefact ou comme un succès."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ArtifactOperationReceipt|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind receiptOperation and receiptArtifact, retain subEventOf context and supplied receiptTool or resultDigest."
msgstr "Lier receiptOperation et receiptArtifact, conserver le contexte subEventOf et les receiptTool ou resultDigest fournis."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ArtifactOperationReceipt|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:operation a gmeow:ArtifactOperationReceipt ; gmeow:subEventOf ex:attempt ."
msgstr "ex:operation a gmeow:ArtifactOperationReceipt ; gmeow:subEventOf ex:attempt ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/readArtifact|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "read artifact"
msgstr "a lu l’artefact"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/readArtifact|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Relates an activity to an information artifact or version it actually read. Reading does not assert that the artifact changed or that its content was accepted as true."
msgstr "Relie une activité à un artefact ou une version informationnelle réellement lu. La lecture n’affirme ni modification ni acceptation du contenu comme vrai."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/readArtifact|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain a read without inventing a write operation."
msgstr "Utiliser pour conserver une lecture sans inventer d’écriture."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/readArtifact|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid restricting read artifacts to published documents."
msgstr "Éviter de limiter les artefacts lus aux documents publiés."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/readArtifact|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference the actual InformationObject or version read; use separate records for later observations."
msgstr "Référencer l’InformationObject ou la version réellement lu ; utiliser des enregistrements distincts pour les observations ultérieures."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/readArtifact|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:read gmeow:readArtifact ex:artifact ."
msgstr "ex:read gmeow:readArtifact ex:artifact ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/conflictsWithGoal|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "conflicts with goal"
msgstr "entre en conflit avec le but"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/conflictsWithGoal|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A recorded non-constitutive conflict between goals, such as competing demands on an agent’s time. The symmetric relation does not define either goal by its opposition and is not transitive."
msgstr "Conflit enregistré non constitutif entre buts, par exemple des demandes concurrentes sur le temps d’un agent. La relation symétrique ne définit aucun but par opposition et n’est pas transitive."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/conflictsWithGoal|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for an attributed practical conflict between goals."
msgstr "Utiliser pour un conflit pratique attribué entre buts."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/conflictsWithGoal|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid bridging this relation to constitutive counterGoal or inferring a global priority."
msgstr "Éviter de relier cette relation au counterGoal constitutif ou d’en déduire une priorité globale."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/conflictsWithGoal|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link the goals and retain standpoint and temporal scope on the statement when relevant."
msgstr "Relier les buts et conserver le point de vue et la portée temporelle sur l’énoncé si pertinent."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/conflictsWithGoal|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:draftGoal gmeow:conflictsWithGoal ex:restGoal ."
msgstr "ex:draftGoal gmeow:conflictsWithGoal ex:restGoal ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/conflictsWithGoalSymmetry|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Goal conflict symmetry"
msgstr "Symétrie du conflit de buts"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/conflictsWithGoalSymmetry|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Canonical symmetry of non-constitutive goal conflict, without a transitivity or constitutive-opposition claim."
msgstr "Symétrie canonique du conflit non constitutif de buts, sans affirmation de transitivité ni d’opposition constitutive."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/conflictsWithGoalSymmetry|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to read the same recorded conflict in either direction."
msgstr "Utiliser pour lire le même conflit dans les deux sens."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/conflictsWithGoalSymmetry|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid extending symmetry into conflict propagation along unrelated goals."
msgstr "Éviter d’étendre la symétrie en propagation du conflit entre buts sans lien."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/conflictsWithGoalSymmetry|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read the canonical characteristic on conflictsWithGoal."
msgstr "Lire la caractéristique canonique sur conflictsWithGoal."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/conflictsWithGoalSymmetry|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:conflictsWithGoalSymmetry logic:characterizes gmeow:conflictsWithGoal ."
msgstr "gmeow:conflictsWithGoalSymmetry logic:characterizes gmeow:conflictsWithGoal ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/toolName|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "tool name"
msgstr "nom d’outil"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/toolName|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The tool name given by the call, verbatim, distinct from the SoftwareAgent that usedTool must still identify."
msgstr "Nom d’outil donné par l’appel, conservé textuellement, distinct du SoftwareAgent que usedTool doit toujours identifier."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/toolName|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the source exposes a name without a rich tool-agent description."
msgstr "Utiliser lorsque la source expose un nom sans description riche de l’agent outil."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/toolName|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid replacing required usedTool with this literal or inferring a holder from the name."
msgstr "Éviter de remplacer usedTool obligatoire par ce littéral ou de déduire un titulaire du nom."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/toolName|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep the string and link usedTool to a minimally described actual source-scoped SoftwareAgent."
msgstr "Conserver la chaîne et relier usedTool à un SoftwareAgent réel, limité à la source et minimalement décrit."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/toolName|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:record gmeow:toolName \"source value\" ."
msgstr "ex:record gmeow:toolName \"source value\" ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/toolCallId|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "tool call identifier"
msgstr "identifiant d’appel d’outil"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/toolCallId|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The identifier carried by this tool call, preserved verbatim in its source scope. It is not a global key or a replacement for the call resource."
msgstr "Identifiant porté par cet appel, conservé textuellement dans sa portée source. Ce n’est ni une clé globale ni un remplacement de la ressource d’appel."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/toolCallId|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain the source identifier by which records referred to the call."
msgstr "Utiliser pour conserver l’identifiant source par lequel des enregistrements référaient à l’appel."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/toolCallId|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid widening unrelated identifier domains or merging calls by a reused local id."
msgstr "Éviter d’élargir des domaines d’identifiant sans lien ou de fusionner des appels par identifiant local réutilisé."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/toolCallId|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep the source string and link assertions with existing derivedBy only when they came from that call."
msgstr "Conserver la chaîne source et relier les assertions par derivedBy seulement lorsqu’elles proviennent de cet appel."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/toolCallId|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:record gmeow:toolCallId \"source value\" ."
msgstr "ex:record gmeow:toolCallId \"source value\" ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/receiptTool|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "receipt tool name"
msgstr "nom d’outil de l’activité consignée"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/receiptTool|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The source-reported tool name for this artifact operation, verbatim. It does not replace a ToolCall’s usedTool agent."
msgstr "Nom d’outil source de cette opération, conservé textuellement. Il ne remplace pas l’agent usedTool d’un ToolCall."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/receiptTool|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when an activity receipt supplies a tool name."
msgstr "Utiliser lorsqu’une activité consignée fournit un nom d’outil."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/receiptTool|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid token whitespace normalization or inferred tool identity from this string alone."
msgstr "Éviter la normalisation des espaces de token ou l’identité d’outil déduite de cette seule chaîne."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/receiptTool|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep the supplied xsd:string or xsd:token tool-name literal and retain the parent attempt or ToolCall separately."
msgstr "Conserver le littéral de nom d’outil xsd:string ou xsd:token fourni et garder séparément la tentative parente ou le ToolCall parent."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/receiptTool|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:record gmeow:receiptTool \"source value\" ."
msgstr "ex:record gmeow:receiptTool \"source value\" ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/resultDigest|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "result digest"
msgstr "empreinte du résultat"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/resultDigest|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A source-provided content digest of what the operation produced or returned. It is not automatically the artifact’s own bytes or the identity of the receipt."
msgstr "Empreinte source du contenu produit ou retourné par l’opération. Ce n’est pas automatiquement l’identité des octets de l’artefact ni de l’activité consignée."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/resultDigest|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain a reported operation-result identity."
msgstr "Utiliser pour conserver une identité rapportée de résultat d’opération."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/resultDigest|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid equating a tool-result envelope digest with the read artifact’s digest."
msgstr "Éviter d’assimiler l’empreinte d’une enveloppe de résultat à celle de l’artefact lu."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/resultDigest|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Use the existing algorithm-labelled digest convention and preserve multiple reported algorithms."
msgstr "Utiliser la convention existante préfixée par l’algorithme et conserver les algorithmes multiples rapportés."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/resultDigest|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:operation gmeow:resultDigest \"sha256:1111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111\" ."
msgstr "ex:operation gmeow:resultDigest \"sha256:1111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111\" ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/artifactComplete|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "artifact complete"
msgstr "artefact achevé"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/artifactComplete|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A source-attributed assertion that the identified artifact is complete or incomplete for its intended content. It is independent of operation success, invocation outcome and receipt completeness."
msgstr "Affirmation source que l’artefact identifié est achevé ou incomplet pour son contenu prévu. Elle est indépendante de la réussite d’opération, du résultat d’invocation et de l’exhaustivité d’un compte rendu."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/artifactComplete|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for an explicitly supplied artifact-completion bit."
msgstr "Utiliser pour un indicateur explicite d’achèvement d’artefact."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/artifactComplete|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid defaulting absent completion to false or deriving goal satisfaction from true."
msgstr "Éviter d’attribuer faux par défaut à l’absence ou de déduire la satisfaction d’un but de vrai."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/artifactComplete|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Put the supplied boolean on the artifact or version; migrate a local receiptComplete field here only when it meant artifact completion."
msgstr "Placer le booléen fourni sur l’artefact ou sa version ; migrer un champ local receiptComplete ici seulement s’il signifiait l’achèvement de l’artefact."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/artifactComplete|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:artifact gmeow:artifactComplete \"true\"^^xsd:boolean ."
msgstr "ex:artifact gmeow:artifactComplete \"true\"^^xsd:boolean ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/invocationError|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "invocation error"
msgstr "erreur d’invocation"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/invocationError|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The source error text for a model invocation, preserved verbatim. Missing text does not prove success and an error does not establish artifact incompleteness."
msgstr "Texte d’erreur source d’une invocation de modèle, conservé textuellement. Son absence ne prouve pas le succès et une erreur n’établit pas l’inachèvement d’un artefact."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/invocationError|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve an appraisal or generation invocation’s reported error."
msgstr "Utiliser pour préserver l’erreur rapportée d’une invocation d’évaluation ou de génération."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/invocationError|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid replacing the source error with a normalized diagnosis or inferring it from status alone."
msgstr "Éviter de remplacer l’erreur source par un diagnostic normalisé ou de la déduire du seul état."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/invocationError|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep the exact string and record invocationOutcome independently when supplied."
msgstr "Conserver la chaîne exacte et consigner invocationOutcome indépendamment lorsqu’il est fourni."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/invocationError|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:record gmeow:invocationError \"source value\" ."
msgstr "ex:record gmeow:invocationError \"source value\" ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/agency-records|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "agency records"
msgstr "enregistrements d’action"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/agency-records|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Source-faithful records of planless attempts, intention lifecycle, artifact operations, tool calls, invocation outcomes and situated agency judgments."
msgstr "Enregistrements fidèles de tentatives sans plan, cycle des intentions, opérations sur artefacts, appels d’outils, résultats d’invocation et jugements d’action situés."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/agency-records|http://purl.org/dc/terms/title"
msgid "GMEOW Agency Records Module"
msgstr "Module GMEOW des enregistrements d’action"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/agency-records|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/sliceConsumer"
msgid "Agent memory importers retaining prose attempts and activity evidence without fabricating compiled plans, successful outcomes or unknown identities."
msgstr "Importateurs de mémoire d’agent conservant les tentatives en prose et leurs éléments d’activité sans fabriquer plans compilés, réussites ou identités inconnues."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/IntentionSalienceObservation|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Intention Salience Observation"
msgstr "Observation de saillance d’intention"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/IntentionSalienceObservation|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A source-attributed numeric observation of an intention’s salience on an explicitly identified producer scale or frame. It is not claim import importance, and no bounds, direction or normalization are implied."
msgstr "Observation numérique attribuée de la saillance d’une intention sur une échelle ou un cadre de producteur explicitement identifié. Ce n’est pas l’importance d’importation d’une affirmation ; aucune borne, direction ou normalisation n’est impliquée."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/IntentionSalienceObservation|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain an intention salience number together with its source convention and vantage."
msgstr "Utiliser pour conserver une saillance d’intention avec sa convention source et son point de vue."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/IntentionSalienceObservation|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid assuming a 0–10 scale or comparing different producer frames without a conversion contract."
msgstr "Éviter de supposer une échelle de 0 à 10 ou de comparer des cadres sans contrat de conversion."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/IntentionSalienceObservation|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind salienceOfIntention, salienceValue, salienceFrame and vantage; reuse a source ScoreScale only when its actual bounds are supplied."
msgstr "Lier salienceOfIntention, salienceValue, salienceFrame et vantage ; réutiliser un ScoreScale source seulement si ses bornes réelles sont fournies."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/IntentionSalienceObservation|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:salience a gmeow:IntentionSalienceObservation ."
msgstr "ex:salience a gmeow:IntentionSalienceObservation ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/salienceOfIntention|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "salience of intention"
msgstr "saillance de l’intention"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/salienceOfIntention|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The intention whose salience this observation reports, specializing the existing observedFeature role."
msgstr "Intention dont cette observation rapporte la saillance, en spécialisant observedFeature."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/salienceOfIntention|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to identify the intention assessed for salience."
msgstr "Utiliser pour identifier l’intention observée pour sa saillance."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/salienceOfIntention|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid putting the observer or scale in this target role."
msgstr "Éviter de placer l’observateur ou l’échelle dans ce rôle cible."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/salienceOfIntention|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference the existing Intention; keep the numerical reading and producer frame on the observation."
msgstr "Référencer l’Intention existante ; conserver la lecture numérique et le cadre sur l’observation."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/salienceOfIntention|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:salience gmeow:salienceOfIntention ex:intention ."
msgstr "ex:salience gmeow:salienceOfIntention ex:intention ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/salienceValue|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "salience value"
msgstr "valeur de saillance"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/salienceValue|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The source decimal salience reading, interpreted only within salienceFrame. A larger number is not assumed to mean greater salience."
msgstr "Lecture décimale source de saillance, interprétée uniquement dans salienceFrame. Un nombre supérieur ne signifie pas nécessairement une saillance supérieure."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/salienceValue|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve the producer’s actual salience number."
msgstr "Utiliser pour préserver le nombre de saillance réel du producteur."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/salienceValue|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid clamping, rescaling or dropping zero readings."
msgstr "Éviter de borner, remettre à l’échelle ou supprimer les valeurs nulles."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/salienceValue|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the decimal with its explicit frame and source attribution."
msgstr "Conserver le décimal avec son cadre explicite et son attribution source."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/salienceValue|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:salience gmeow:salienceValue \"17.5\"^^xsd:decimal ."
msgstr "ex:salience gmeow:salienceValue \"17.5\"^^xsd:decimal ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/salienceFrame|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "salience source frame"
msgstr "cadre source de saillance"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/salienceFrame|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The source-defined convention identifying what a salience number means. An InformationObject may identify an opaque producer scale; unknown bounds or direction remain unknown."
msgstr "Convention source identifiant le sens d’un nombre de saillance. Un InformationObject peut identifier une échelle opaque ; les bornes ou direction inconnues restent inconnues."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/salienceFrame|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to keep salience values scoped to the producer’s scale or frame."
msgstr "Utiliser pour délimiter les valeurs à l’échelle ou au cadre du producteur."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/salienceFrame|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inventing scale bounds or equating differently named producer conventions."
msgstr "Éviter d’inventer des bornes ou d’assimiler des conventions de producteurs distinctes."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/salienceFrame|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference the producer’s convention artifact; it may be a ScoreScale when its numeric contract is actually known."
msgstr "Référencer l’artefact de convention du producteur ; ce peut être un ScoreScale si son contrat numérique est réellement connu."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/salienceFrame|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:salience gmeow:salienceFrame ex:producerConvention ."
msgstr "ex:salience gmeow:salienceFrame ex:producerConvention ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/VerifierKind|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Verifier Kind"
msgstr "Type de vérificateur"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/VerifierKind|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An open vocabulary of methods used to assess satisfaction conditions, including artifact checks, observations, assertions, retained memory, reflective appraisals, environment records and foreground yields. Selecting a method is not a verdict that its condition holds."
msgstr "Vocabulaire ouvert de méthodes d’évaluation des conditions de satisfaction, dont contrôles d’artefacts, observations, assertions, mémoire conservée, appréciations réflexives, fiches d’environnement et cessions au premier plan. Choisir une méthode n’est pas un verdict que sa condition est remplie."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/VerifierKind|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain a configured condition-verification method or an actual observation's verification method without conflating those records."
msgstr "Utiliser pour conserver une méthode configurée de vérification de condition ou celle d’une observation réelle, sans confondre ces enregistrements."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/VerifierKind|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating verifier kind as a successful outcome or an agent identity."
msgstr "Éviter de traiter le type de vérificateur comme réussite ou identité d’agent."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/VerifierKind|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Use conditionVerifierKind on configuration descriptors and verifierKind on actual artifact verification observations; retain reported observation verdicts separately through observationResult."
msgstr "Utiliser conditionVerifierKind sur les descripteurs de configuration et verifierKind sur les observations réelles de vérification d’artefact ; conserver séparément les verdicts observés par observationResult."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/VerifierKind|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:check gmeow:verifierKind gmeow:verifierArtifactReadAfterWrite ."
msgstr "ex:check gmeow:verifierKind gmeow:verifierArtifactReadAfterWrite ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierArtifactReadAfterWrite|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "artifact read after write"
msgstr "lecture d’artefact après écriture"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierArtifactReadAfterWrite|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Verification by an actual later read of the same identified artifact version that was written. A held verdict requires read and write evidence and artifact byte identity, not merely the writer’s own report."
msgstr "Vérification par lecture réellement ultérieure de la même version identifiée qui a été écrite. Un verdict tenu exige des éléments de lecture et écriture et l’identité des octets, pas le seul rapport de l’auteur de l’écriture."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierArtifactReadAfterWrite|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for source-observed read-back verification of a written artifact."
msgstr "Utiliser pour une vérification source par relecture d’un artefact écrit."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierArtifactReadAfterWrite|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming confirmation from a selected method without a later read."
msgstr "Éviter d’affirmer confirmation à partir d’une méthode choisie sans lecture ultérieure."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierArtifactReadAfterWrite|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Select this kind on an ArtifactVerificationObservation and retain the actual operation receipts, version identity and verdict."
msgstr "Choisir ce type sur une ArtifactVerificationObservation et conserver opérations, identité de version et verdict réels."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierArtifactReadAfterWrite|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:check gmeow:verifierKind gmeow:verifierArtifactReadAfterWrite ."
msgstr "ex:check gmeow:verifierKind gmeow:verifierArtifactReadAfterWrite ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ArtifactVerificationObservation|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Artifact Verification Observation"
msgstr "Observation de vérification d’artefact"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ArtifactVerificationObservation|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A vantage-attributed observation assessing an identified artifact or version by a declared verifier method. Any verdict is separate from the method, receipt result and invocation outcome."
msgstr "Observation attribuée à un point de vue évaluant un artefact ou version identifié par une méthode déclarée. Le verdict est distinct de la méthode, du résultat d’opération et du résultat d’invocation."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ArtifactVerificationObservation|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain an artifact check with its source evidence and observer."
msgstr "Utiliser pour conserver une vérification d’artefact avec ses éléments sources et son observateur."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ArtifactVerificationObservation|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid using the Attestation-domain verificationResult property as an activity output link."
msgstr "Éviter d’utiliser verificationResult, de domaine Attestation, comme lien de sortie d’activité."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ArtifactVerificationObservation|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind verifiesArtifact, verifierKind and vantage; use existing evaluation verdict individuals through observationResult when reported."
msgstr "Lier verifiesArtifact, verifierKind et vantage ; utiliser les verdicts d’évaluation existants par observationResult lorsqu’ils sont rapportés."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ArtifactVerificationObservation|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:check a gmeow:ArtifactVerificationObservation ."
msgstr "ex:check a gmeow:ArtifactVerificationObservation ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierKind|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "verifier kind"
msgstr "type de vérificateur"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierKind|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The source-selected method of an artifact verification observation, independent of its result."
msgstr "Méthode choisie par la source pour une observation de vérification, indépendante du résultat."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierKind|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve the source’s verifier kind binding."
msgstr "Utiliser pour préserver le lien source : type de vérificateur."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierKind|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inventing missing evidence for verifierKind."
msgstr "Éviter d’inventer des éléments absents pour verifierKind."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierKind|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference the source-supported verifierKind target and preserve its attribution context."
msgstr "Référencer la cible verifierKind étayée par la source et préserver son contexte d’attribution."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierKind|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:record gmeow:verifierKind ex:target ."
msgstr "ex:record gmeow:verifierKind ex:target ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifiesArtifact|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "verifies artifact"
msgstr "vérifie l’artefact"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifiesArtifact|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The exact artifact or version assessed by this observation, specializing observedFeature."
msgstr "Artefact ou version exacte évalué par cette observation, en spécialisant observedFeature."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifiesArtifact|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve the source’s verifies artifact binding."
msgstr "Utiliser pour préserver le lien source : vérifie l’artefact."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifiesArtifact|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inventing missing evidence for verifiesArtifact."
msgstr "Éviter d’inventer des éléments absents pour verifiesArtifact."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifiesArtifact|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference the source-supported verifiesArtifact target and preserve its attribution context."
msgstr "Référencer la cible verifiesArtifact étayée par la source et préserver son contexte d’attribution."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifiesArtifact|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:record gmeow:verifiesArtifact ex:target ."
msgstr "ex:record gmeow:verifiesArtifact ex:target ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verificationWriteReceipt|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "verification write receipt"
msgstr "activité d’écriture de vérification"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verificationWriteReceipt|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The actual created-or-updated operation occurrence used as write evidence, not a fabricated successful invocation."
msgstr "Occurrence réelle de création ou mise à jour servant d’élément d’écriture, pas une invocation réussie fabriquée."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verificationWriteReceipt|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve the source’s verification write receipt binding."
msgstr "Utiliser pour préserver le lien source : activité d’écriture de vérification."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verificationWriteReceipt|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inventing missing evidence for verificationWriteReceipt."
msgstr "Éviter d’inventer des éléments absents pour verificationWriteReceipt."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verificationWriteReceipt|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference the source-supported verificationWriteReceipt target and preserve its attribution context."
msgstr "Référencer la cible verificationWriteReceipt étayée par la source et préserver son contexte d’attribution."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verificationWriteReceipt|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:record gmeow:verificationWriteReceipt ex:target ."
msgstr "ex:record gmeow:verificationWriteReceipt ex:target ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verificationReadReceipt|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "verification read receipt"
msgstr "activité de lecture de vérification"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verificationReadReceipt|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The actual later-read operation occurrence used as independent read-back evidence."
msgstr "Occurrence réelle de lecture ultérieure servant d’élément indépendant de relecture."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verificationReadReceipt|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve the source’s verification read receipt binding."
msgstr "Utiliser pour préserver le lien source : activité de lecture de vérification."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verificationReadReceipt|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inventing missing evidence for verificationReadReceipt."
msgstr "Éviter d’inventer des éléments absents pour verificationReadReceipt."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verificationReadReceipt|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference the source-supported verificationReadReceipt target and preserve its attribution context."
msgstr "Référencer la cible verificationReadReceipt étayée par la source et préserver son contexte d’attribution."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verificationReadReceipt|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:record gmeow:verificationReadReceipt ex:target ."
msgstr "ex:record gmeow:verificationReadReceipt ex:target ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/agencyGoalEvaluation|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "agency goal evaluation"
msgstr "évaluation du but de l’action"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/agencyGoalEvaluation|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A separate GoalEvaluation supporting a recorded agency judgment; it does not follow merely from attempt stopping."
msgstr "GoalEvaluation distincte étayant un jugement enregistré ; elle ne découle pas du seul arrêt d’une tentative."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/agencyGoalEvaluation|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve the source’s agency goal evaluation binding."
msgstr "Utiliser pour préserver le lien source : évaluation du but de l’action."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/agencyGoalEvaluation|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inventing missing evidence for agencyGoalEvaluation."
msgstr "Éviter d’inventer des éléments absents pour agencyGoalEvaluation."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/agencyGoalEvaluation|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference the source-supported agencyGoalEvaluation target and preserve its attribution context."
msgstr "Référencer la cible agencyGoalEvaluation étayée par la source et préserver son contexte d’attribution."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/agencyGoalEvaluation|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:record gmeow:agencyGoalEvaluation ex:target ."
msgstr "ex:record gmeow:agencyGoalEvaluation ex:target ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ReceiptParentConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Receipt parent constraint"
msgstr "Contrainte de parent de l’activité consignée"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ReceiptParentConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An artifact operation receipt belongs to an actual attempt or ToolCall, rather than an unrelated event."
msgstr "Une opération consignée appartient à une tentative réelle ou à un ToolCall, plutôt qu’à un événement sans lien."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ReceiptParentConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to enforce the source-evidence obligation of ArtifactOperationReceipt."
msgstr "Utiliser pour faire respecter l’obligation d’éléments sources de ArtifactOperationReceipt."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ReceiptParentConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid satisfying ReceiptParentConstraint by fabricating missing source data."
msgstr "Éviter de satisfaire ReceiptParentConstraint en fabriquant des données sources absentes."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ReceiptParentConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the actual ArtifactOperationReceipt bindings expressed by this canonical formula."
msgstr "Conserver les liens réels de ArtifactOperationReceipt exprimés par cette formule canonique."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ReceiptParentConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:ReceiptParentConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:ArtifactOperationReceipt ."
msgstr "gmeow:ReceiptParentConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:ArtifactOperationReceipt ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ReceiptReadArtifactConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Receipt read-artifact constraint"
msgstr "Contrainte de lecture de l’artefact consigné"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ReceiptReadArtifactConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A read receipt retains an actual readArtifact relation to the same identified artifact version, not merely a result-envelope digest."
msgstr "Une lecture consignée conserve readArtifact vers la même version identifiée, pas seulement une empreinte d’enveloppe de résultat."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ReceiptReadArtifactConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to enforce the source-evidence obligation of readArtifact."
msgstr "Utiliser pour faire respecter l’obligation d’éléments sources de readArtifact."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ReceiptReadArtifactConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid satisfying ReceiptReadArtifactConstraint by fabricating missing source data."
msgstr "Éviter de satisfaire ReceiptReadArtifactConstraint en fabriquant des données sources absentes."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ReceiptReadArtifactConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the actual readArtifact bindings expressed by this canonical formula."
msgstr "Conserver les liens réels de readArtifact exprimés par cette formule canonique."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ReceiptReadArtifactConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:ReceiptReadArtifactConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:readArtifact ."
msgstr "gmeow:ReceiptReadArtifactConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:readArtifact ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BudgetResumePointConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Budget resume-point constraint"
msgstr "Contrainte de point de reprise de budget"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BudgetResumePointConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A budget-checkpoint pause retains an actual source resume point; it does not create enactment checkpoint identity."
msgstr "Une pause de budget conserve un point réel de reprise source ; elle ne crée pas une identité de reprise de réalisation."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BudgetResumePointConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to enforce the source-evidence obligation of pauseBudgetCheckpoint."
msgstr "Utiliser pour faire respecter l’obligation d’éléments sources de pauseBudgetCheckpoint."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BudgetResumePointConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid satisfying BudgetResumePointConstraint by fabricating missing source data."
msgstr "Éviter de satisfaire BudgetResumePointConstraint en fabriquant des données sources absentes."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BudgetResumePointConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the actual pauseBudgetCheckpoint bindings expressed by this canonical formula."
msgstr "Conserver les liens réels de pauseBudgetCheckpoint exprimés par cette formule canonique."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BudgetResumePointConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:BudgetResumePointConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:pauseBudgetCheckpoint ."
msgstr "gmeow:BudgetResumePointConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:pauseBudgetCheckpoint ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AttemptResumptionBindingsConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Attempt resumption bindings constraint"
msgstr "Contrainte de liens de reprise de tentative"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AttemptResumptionBindingsConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A planless resumption identifies its original attempt and actual resume point as a sub-event of that attempt, without borrowing enactment continuation kinds."
msgstr "Une reprise sans plan identifie sa tentative originale et son point réel comme sous-événement de cette tentative, sans emprunter les types de continuation de réalisation."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AttemptResumptionBindingsConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to enforce the source-evidence obligation of eventTypeAttemptResumption."
msgstr "Utiliser pour faire respecter l’obligation d’éléments sources de eventTypeAttemptResumption."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AttemptResumptionBindingsConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid satisfying AttemptResumptionBindingsConstraint by fabricating missing source data."
msgstr "Éviter de satisfaire AttemptResumptionBindingsConstraint en fabriquant des données sources absentes."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AttemptResumptionBindingsConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the actual eventTypeAttemptResumption bindings expressed by this canonical formula."
msgstr "Conserver les liens réels de eventTypeAttemptResumption exprimés par cette formule canonique."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AttemptResumptionBindingsConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:AttemptResumptionBindingsConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:eventTypeAttemptResumption ."
msgstr "gmeow:AttemptResumptionBindingsConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:eventTypeAttemptResumption ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/IntentionTransitionTargetConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Intention transition target constraint"
msgstr "Contrainte de cible de transition d’intention"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/IntentionTransitionTargetConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A recorded intention lifecycle event identifies the actual affected Intention; its marker does not fabricate a new intention."
msgstr "Un événement de cycle d’intention identifie l’Intention réellement concernée ; son marqueur n’en fabrique pas une nouvelle."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/IntentionTransitionTargetConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to enforce the source-evidence obligation of intentionTransitionOf."
msgstr "Utiliser pour faire respecter l’obligation d’éléments sources de intentionTransitionOf."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/IntentionTransitionTargetConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid satisfying IntentionTransitionTargetConstraint by fabricating missing source data."
msgstr "Éviter de satisfaire IntentionTransitionTargetConstraint en fabriquant des données sources absentes."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/IntentionTransitionTargetConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the actual intentionTransitionOf bindings expressed by this canonical formula."
msgstr "Conserver les liens réels de intentionTransitionOf exprimés par cette formule canonique."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/IntentionTransitionTargetConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:IntentionTransitionTargetConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:intentionTransitionOf ."
msgstr "gmeow:IntentionTransitionTargetConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:intentionTransitionOf ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/IntentionSupersessionTargetConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Intention supersession target constraint"
msgstr "Contrainte de remplacement d’intention"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/IntentionSupersessionTargetConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A supersession retains the replacement intention through supersededBy on the old intention, without inferring goal satisfaction."
msgstr "Un remplacement conserve l’intention remplaçante par supersededBy sur l’ancienne, sans déduire la satisfaction du but."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/IntentionSupersessionTargetConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to enforce the source-evidence obligation of eventTypeIntentionSuperseded."
msgstr "Utiliser pour faire respecter l’obligation d’éléments sources de eventTypeIntentionSuperseded."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/IntentionSupersessionTargetConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid satisfying IntentionSupersessionTargetConstraint by fabricating missing source data."
msgstr "Éviter de satisfaire IntentionSupersessionTargetConstraint en fabriquant des données sources absentes."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/IntentionSupersessionTargetConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the actual eventTypeIntentionSuperseded bindings expressed by this canonical formula."
msgstr "Conserver les liens réels de eventTypeIntentionSuperseded exprimés par cette formule canonique."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/IntentionSupersessionTargetConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:IntentionSupersessionTargetConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:eventTypeIntentionSuperseded ."
msgstr "gmeow:IntentionSupersessionTargetConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:eventTypeIntentionSuperseded ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/SatisfiedIntentionEvaluationConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Satisfied intention evaluation constraint"
msgstr "Contrainte d’évaluation d’intention satisfaite"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/SatisfiedIntentionEvaluationConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An intention-satisfied event retains its separate GoalEvaluation judgment; an attempt stop value is not that verdict."
msgstr "Un événement d’intention satisfaite conserve son jugement GoalEvaluation distinct ; une valeur d’arrêt de tentative n’est pas ce verdict."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/SatisfiedIntentionEvaluationConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to enforce the source-evidence obligation of eventTypeIntentionSatisfied."
msgstr "Utiliser pour faire respecter l’obligation d’éléments sources de eventTypeIntentionSatisfied."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/SatisfiedIntentionEvaluationConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid satisfying SatisfiedIntentionEvaluationConstraint by fabricating missing source data."
msgstr "Éviter de satisfaire SatisfiedIntentionEvaluationConstraint en fabriquant des données sources absentes."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/SatisfiedIntentionEvaluationConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the actual eventTypeIntentionSatisfied bindings expressed by this canonical formula."
msgstr "Conserver les liens réels de eventTypeIntentionSatisfied exprimés par cette formule canonique."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/SatisfiedIntentionEvaluationConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:SatisfiedIntentionEvaluationConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:eventTypeIntentionSatisfied ."
msgstr "gmeow:SatisfiedIntentionEvaluationConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:eventTypeIntentionSatisfied ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ReadAfterWriteEvidenceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Read-after-write evidence constraint"
msgstr "Contrainte d’éléments de relecture après écriture"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ReadAfterWriteEvidenceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A held read-after-write verdict requires distinct actual write and later-read receipts for the same digest-identified artifact version. Result-envelope digests are not artifact digests."
msgstr "Un verdict tenu de relecture exige des opérations réelles distinctes d’écriture et de lecture ultérieure de la même version identifiée par empreinte. Les empreintes d’enveloppe ne sont pas celles de l’artefact."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ReadAfterWriteEvidenceConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to enforce the source-evidence obligation of verifierArtifactReadAfterWrite."
msgstr "Utiliser pour faire respecter l’obligation d’éléments sources de verifierArtifactReadAfterWrite."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ReadAfterWriteEvidenceConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid satisfying ReadAfterWriteEvidenceConstraint by fabricating missing source data."
msgstr "Éviter de satisfaire ReadAfterWriteEvidenceConstraint en fabriquant des données sources absentes."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ReadAfterWriteEvidenceConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the actual verifierArtifactReadAfterWrite bindings expressed by this canonical formula."
msgstr "Conserver les liens réels de verifierArtifactReadAfterWrite exprimés par cette formule canonique."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ReadAfterWriteEvidenceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:ReadAfterWriteEvidenceConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:verifierArtifactReadAfterWrite ."
msgstr "gmeow:ReadAfterWriteEvidenceConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:verifierArtifactReadAfterWrite ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AttemptStopFinishConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Attempt stop finish constraint"
msgstr "Contrainte de fin pour l’arrêt de tentative"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AttemptStopFinishConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An attemptStop value classifies a recorded attempt-finish event, rather than an unrelated activity or goal evaluation."
msgstr "Une valeur attemptStop classe un événement enregistré de fin de tentative, plutôt qu’une activité sans lien ou une évaluation de but."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AttemptStopFinishConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain the phase scope of attemptStop."
msgstr "Utiliser pour conserver la portée de phase de attemptStop."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AttemptStopFinishConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid attaching attemptStop to an event with an unrelated lifecycle meaning."
msgstr "Éviter de rattacher attemptStop à un événement au sens de cycle sans lien."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AttemptStopFinishConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep eventType eventTypeAttemptFinish on the event carrying attemptStop."
msgstr "Conserver eventType eventTypeAttemptFinish sur l’événement portant attemptStop."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AttemptStopFinishConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:phase gmeow:eventType gmeow:eventTypeAttemptFinish ."
msgstr "ex:phase gmeow:eventType gmeow:eventTypeAttemptFinish ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/PauseCauseContinuationConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Pause cause continuation constraint"
msgstr "Contrainte de continuation pour la cause de pause"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/PauseCauseContinuationConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A pauseCause value belongs to a recorded attempt-continuation phase, not an intention’s overall holding status."
msgstr "Une valeur pauseCause appartient à une phase enregistrée de continuation de tentative, pas à l’état global de maintien d’une intention."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/PauseCauseContinuationConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain the phase scope of pauseCause."
msgstr "Utiliser pour conserver la portée de phase de pauseCause."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/PauseCauseContinuationConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid attaching pauseCause to an event with an unrelated lifecycle meaning."
msgstr "Éviter de rattacher pauseCause à un événement au sens de cycle sans lien."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/PauseCauseContinuationConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep eventType eventTypeAttemptContinuation on the event carrying pauseCause."
msgstr "Conserver eventType eventTypeAttemptContinuation sur l’événement portant pauseCause."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/PauseCauseContinuationConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:phase gmeow:eventType gmeow:eventTypeAttemptContinuation ."
msgstr "ex:phase gmeow:eventType gmeow:eventTypeAttemptContinuation ."

# Story-building and witness-purpose vocabulary.

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/defectFixedBy|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "defect fixed by"
msgstr "défaut corrigé par"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/defectFixedBy|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Relates a record of a defect in an agent's system to the repair activity or information artifact reported to have resolved it. Resolution is an attributed source claim, not a conclusion drawn from a missing defect or an unrelated successful operation."
msgstr "Relie un enregistrement de défaut du système d’un agent à l’activité de réparation ou à l’artefact informationnel déclaré l’avoir résolu. La résolution est une affirmation source attribuée, non une conclusion tirée de l’absence du défaut ou d’une opération réussie sans rapport."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/defectFixedBy|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "A repair activity is an occurrent and a fix artifact is an information object; neither is coerced into the other. Multiple attributed resolution claims remain possible."
msgstr "Une activité de réparation est un occurrent et un artefact correctif un objet informationnel ; aucun n’est converti en l’autre. Plusieurs affirmations de résolution attribuées restent possibles."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/defectFixedBy|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:defectRecord gmeow:defectFixedBy ex:fixArtifact ."
msgstr "ex:defectRecord gmeow:defectFixedBy ex:fixArtifact ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/witnessedForIntention|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "witnessed for intention"
msgstr "observé pour l’intention"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/witnessedForIntention|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Relates a witness observation to the intention it was gathered for, including observation in a simulated environment. This is its reported purpose, distinct from the observed feature and from whether the intention's goal was satisfied."
msgstr "Relie une observation témoin à l’intention pour laquelle elle a été recueillie, y compris dans un environnement simulé. Il s’agit de son but rapporté, distinct de la caractéristique observée et de la satisfaction du but de l’intention."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/witnessedForIntention|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Observation and intention retain their own identities and provenance. The purpose link does not assert observationResult, change observedFeature or prove simulated execution."
msgstr "L’observation et l’intention conservent leurs identités et provenances. Le lien de but n’affirme pas observationResult, ne change pas observedFeature et ne prouve pas une exécution simulée."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/witnessedForIntention|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:witness gmeow:witnessedForIntention ex:intention ."
msgstr "ex:witness gmeow:witnessedForIntention ex:intention ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/DefectResolutionAttributionConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Defect resolution attribution constraint"
msgstr "Contrainte d’attribution de la résolution d’un défaut"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/DefectResolutionAttributionConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every asserted defectFixedBy link retains an exact matching statement reifier attributed to the Agent reporting the resolution."
msgstr "Chaque lien defectFixedBy affirmé conserve un réificateur d’énoncé correspondant exactement et attribué à l’Agent qui rapporte la résolution."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/DefectResolutionAttributionConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Completed statement-metadata lowering supplies the exact statement components. Attribution does not prove repair execution, fix efficacy or a uniquely preferred remedy."
msgstr "L’abaissement achevé des métadonnées d’énoncé fournit les composants exacts. L’attribution ne prouve ni exécution de la réparation, ni efficacité du correctif, ni remède privilégié unique."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/DefectResolutionAttributionConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:DefectResolutionAttributionConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:defectFixedBy ."
msgstr "gmeow:DefectResolutionAttributionConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:defectFixedBy ."

# Goals, attempts and source-faithful satisfaction evidence.

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/hasSatisfactionCondition|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "has satisfaction condition"
msgstr "a pour condition de satisfaction"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/hasSatisfactionCondition|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A goal's source-stated satisfaction condition, ordered by entryOrdinal on the condition occurrence. It is prose criteria, independent of the executable logic:hasGoalCondition expression."
msgstr "Condition de satisfaction énoncée par la source pour un but, ordonnée par entryOrdinal sur son occurrence. Ce critère en prose est indépendant de l’expression exécutable logic:hasGoalCondition."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/hasSatisfactionCondition|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the source explicitly supplies this relation and its context."
msgstr "Utiliser lorsque la source fournit explicitement cette relation et son contexte."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/hasSatisfactionCondition|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inventing missing source bindings or inferring execution and success from this record alone."
msgstr "Éviter d’inventer des liens source absents ou de déduire exécution et réussite de ce seul enregistrement."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/hasSatisfactionCondition|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain actual source values, identities and attribution; preserve supplied wording, language and direction."
msgstr "Conserver valeurs, identités et attribution réelles de la source ; préserver formulation, langue et direction fournies."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/hasSatisfactionCondition|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Source evidence and configuration remain distinct. Competing attributed records may coexist without a preferred claim."
msgstr "Les preuves source et la configuration restent distinctes. Des enregistrements attribués concurrents peuvent coexister sans déclaration privilégiée."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/hasSatisfactionCondition|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:record gmeow:hasSatisfactionCondition ex:target ."
msgstr "ex:record gmeow:hasSatisfactionCondition ex:target ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ConditionVerifier|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Condition Verifier"
msgstr "Vérificateur de condition"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ConditionVerifier|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An information-object descriptor naming a condition key, verification method and expected content. It configures verification without being a Criterion, an observation, an executable check or a satisfaction verdict."
msgstr "Objet informationnel décrivant une clé de condition, une méthode de vérification et le contenu attendu. Il configure la vérification sans être un Criterion, une observation, un contrôle exécutable ou un verdict de satisfaction."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ConditionVerifier|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the source explicitly records a configured condition-verification descriptor."
msgstr "Utiliser lorsque la source consigne explicitement un descripteur configuré de vérification de condition."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ConditionVerifier|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inventing missing source bindings or inferring execution and success from this record alone."
msgstr "Éviter d’inventer des liens source absents ou de déduire exécution et réussite de ce seul enregistrement."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ConditionVerifier|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain actual source values, identities and attribution; preserve supplied wording, language and direction."
msgstr "Conserver valeurs, identités et attribution réelles de la source ; préserver formulation, langue et direction fournies."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ConditionVerifier|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Source evidence and configuration remain distinct. Competing attributed records may coexist without a preferred claim."
msgstr "Les preuves source et la configuration restent distinctes. Des enregistrements attribués concurrents peuvent coexister sans déclaration privilégiée."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ConditionVerifier|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:descriptor a gmeow:ConditionVerifier ."
msgstr "ex:descriptor a gmeow:ConditionVerifier ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/hasConditionVerifier|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "has condition verifier"
msgstr "a pour vérificateur de condition"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/hasConditionVerifier|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A goal's configured condition verifier. Matching source keys associate the descriptor with a condition of this same goal; selecting it supplies no evidence or verdict."
msgstr "Vérificateur de condition configuré pour un but. Les clés source correspondantes l’associent à une condition de ce même but ; sa sélection ne fournit ni preuve ni verdict."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/hasConditionVerifier|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the source explicitly supplies this relation and its context."
msgstr "Utiliser lorsque la source fournit explicitement cette relation et son contexte."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/hasConditionVerifier|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inventing missing source bindings or inferring execution and success from this record alone."
msgstr "Éviter d’inventer des liens source absents ou de déduire exécution et réussite de ce seul enregistrement."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/hasConditionVerifier|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain actual source values, identities and attribution; preserve supplied wording, language and direction."
msgstr "Conserver valeurs, identités et attribution réelles de la source ; préserver formulation, langue et direction fournies."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/hasConditionVerifier|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Source evidence and configuration remain distinct. Competing attributed records may coexist without a preferred claim."
msgstr "Les preuves source et la configuration restent distinctes. Des enregistrements attribués concurrents peuvent coexister sans déclaration privilégiée."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/hasConditionVerifier|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:record gmeow:hasConditionVerifier ex:target ."
msgstr "ex:record gmeow:hasConditionVerifier ex:target ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/conditionVerifierKind|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "condition verifier kind"
msgstr "type de vérificateur de condition"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/conditionVerifierKind|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The configured method of a condition verifier, distinct from verifierKind on an actual artifact verification observation. A method selection never asserts that it ran or succeeded."
msgstr "Méthode configurée d’un vérificateur de condition, distincte de verifierKind sur une observation réelle de vérification d’artefact. Sa sélection n’affirme jamais son exécution ni sa réussite."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/conditionVerifierKind|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the source explicitly supplies this relation and its context."
msgstr "Utiliser lorsque la source fournit explicitement cette relation et son contexte."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/conditionVerifierKind|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inventing missing source bindings or inferring execution and success from this record alone."
msgstr "Éviter d’inventer des liens source absents ou de déduire exécution et réussite de ce seul enregistrement."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/conditionVerifierKind|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain actual source values, identities and attribution; preserve supplied wording, language and direction."
msgstr "Conserver valeurs, identités et attribution réelles de la source ; préserver formulation, langue et direction fournies."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/conditionVerifierKind|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Source evidence and configuration remain distinct. Competing attributed records may coexist without a preferred claim."
msgstr "Les preuves source et la configuration restent distinctes. Des enregistrements attribués concurrents peuvent coexister sans déclaration privilégiée."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/conditionVerifierKind|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:record gmeow:conditionVerifierKind ex:target ."
msgstr "ex:record gmeow:conditionVerifierKind ex:target ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierKey|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "verifier key"
msgstr "clé de vérificateur"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierKey|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The exact source key naming a checked condition, retained on its Condition occurrence, ConditionVerifier descriptor and reified goal-evaluation evidence citation. Equality is scoped to the containing goal and exact evaluation citation, never global identity or whitespace normalization."
msgstr "Clé source exacte de la condition contrôlée, conservée sur son occurrence Condition, son descripteur ConditionVerifier et la citation réifiée de preuve d’évaluation du but. L’égalité est limitée au but contenant et à la citation exacte d’évaluation, sans identité globale ni normalisation des espaces."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierKey|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the source explicitly supplies this relation and its context."
msgstr "Utiliser lorsque la source fournit explicitement cette relation et son contexte."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierKey|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inventing missing source bindings or inferring execution and success from this record alone."
msgstr "Éviter d’inventer des liens source absents ou de déduire exécution et réussite de ce seul enregistrement."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierKey|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep the supplied xsd:string or xsd:token key on its actual condition, configured verifier and exact evidence citation. Retain the same complete literal, including datatype, across those scoped bindings."
msgstr "Conserver la clé xsd:string ou xsd:token fournie sur sa condition réelle, son vérificateur configuré et sa citation de preuve exacte. Garder le même littéral complet, type de données compris, dans ces liaisons délimitées."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierKey|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Preserve the supplied lexical form and datatype: verbatim xsd:string and explicitly supplied xsd:token are admitted. Do not normalize whitespace, retype a string or infer token typing. These declarations do not install a token lexical checker. Key binding remains local to the containing goal and exact evaluation citation; it does not establish global identity."
msgstr "Préserver la forme lexicale et le type de données fournis : les xsd:string verbatim et les xsd:token explicitement fournis sont admis. Ne pas normaliser les espaces, changer le type d’une chaîne ni déduire un type token. Ces déclarations n’installent aucun vérificateur lexical de token. La liaison par clé reste locale à l’objectif contenant et à la citation d’évaluation exacte ; elle n’établit pas d’identité globale."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierKey|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:record gmeow:verifierKey \"source-value\" ."
msgstr "ex:record gmeow:verifierKey \"source-value\" ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierTitle|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "verifier title"
msgstr "titre du vérificateur"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierTitle|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The source's artifact title used by a verifier, verbatim. A title does not identify artifact bytes, prove existence or replace a versioned artifact reference."
msgstr "Titre d’artefact employé par le vérificateur, conservé textuellement. Un titre n’identifie pas les octets, ne prouve pas l’existence et ne remplace pas une référence de version."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierTitle|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the source explicitly supplies this relation and its context."
msgstr "Utiliser lorsque la source fournit explicitement cette relation et son contexte."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierTitle|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inventing missing source bindings or inferring execution and success from this record alone."
msgstr "Éviter d’inventer des liens source absents ou de déduire exécution et réussite de ce seul enregistrement."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierTitle|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain actual source values, identities and attribution; preserve supplied wording, language and direction."
msgstr "Conserver valeurs, identités et attribution réelles de la source ; préserver formulation, langue et direction fournies."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierTitle|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Source evidence and configuration remain distinct. Competing attributed records may coexist without a preferred claim."
msgstr "Les preuves source et la configuration restent distinctes. Des enregistrements attribués concurrents peuvent coexister sans déclaration privilégiée."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierTitle|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:record gmeow:verifierTitle \"source-value\" ."
msgstr "ex:record gmeow:verifierTitle \"source-value\" ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expectedText|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "expected text"
msgstr "texte attendu"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expectedText|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Expected source wording, retained verbatim with its supplied language and direction. Expectation is independent of observed content and does not become evidence by repetition."
msgstr "Formulation attendue de la source, conservée textuellement avec sa langue et sa direction fournies. L’attente est indépendante du contenu observé ; sa répétition ne constitue pas une preuve."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expectedText|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the source explicitly supplies this relation and its context."
msgstr "Utiliser lorsque la source fournit explicitement cette relation et son contexte."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expectedText|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inventing missing source bindings or inferring execution and success from this record alone."
msgstr "Éviter d’inventer des liens source absents ou de déduire exécution et réussite de ce seul enregistrement."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expectedText|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain actual source values, identities and attribution; preserve supplied wording, language and direction."
msgstr "Conserver valeurs, identités et attribution réelles de la source ; préserver formulation, langue et direction fournies."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expectedText|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Source evidence and configuration remain distinct. Competing attributed records may coexist without a preferred claim."
msgstr "Les preuves source et la configuration restent distinctes. Des enregistrements attribués concurrents peuvent coexister sans déclaration privilégiée."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expectedText|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:record gmeow:expectedText \"source-value\" ."
msgstr "ex:record gmeow:expectedText \"source-value\" ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expectedStatement|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "expected statement"
msgstr "énoncé attendu"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expectedStatement|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An expected observation statement represented as a native RDF 1.2 triple term, shared with an explicit rdf:reifies binding. Quotation preserves structure without asserting the quoted proposition or implementing a checker."
msgstr "Énoncé d’observation attendu représenté par un terme de triplet RDF 1.2 natif, partagé avec un lien rdf:reifies explicite. La citation conserve la structure sans affirmer la proposition ni implémenter un contrôle."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expectedStatement|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the source explicitly supplies this relation and its context."
msgstr "Utiliser lorsque la source fournit explicitement cette relation et son contexte."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expectedStatement|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inventing missing source bindings or inferring execution and success from this record alone."
msgstr "Éviter d’inventer des liens source absents ou de déduire exécution et réussite de ce seul enregistrement."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expectedStatement|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain actual source values, identities and attribution; preserve supplied wording, language and direction."
msgstr "Conserver valeurs, identités et attribution réelles de la source ; préserver formulation, langue et direction fournies."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expectedStatement|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Source evidence and configuration remain distinct. Competing attributed records may coexist without a preferred claim."
msgstr "Les preuves source et la configuration restent distinctes. Des enregistrements attribués concurrents peuvent coexister sans déclaration privilégiée."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expectedStatement|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain the expected triple term and its explicit reification: ex:descriptor gmeow:expectedStatement <<( ex:item gmeow:displayable true )>> ; rdf:reifies <<( ex:item gmeow:displayable true )>> ."
msgstr "Conserver le terme de triplet attendu et sa réification explicite : ex:descriptor gmeow:expectedStatement <<( ex:item gmeow:displayable true )>> ; rdf:reifies <<( ex:item gmeow:displayable true )>> ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expectedWorldObject|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "expected world object"
msgstr "objet de monde attendu"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expectedWorldObject|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The exact unresolved simulated-object identifier supplied by the source. Resolution requires a provider-and-world-scoped WorldObjectRecord; matching text alone never creates an object identity."
msgstr "Identifiant exact non résolu d’objet simulé fourni par la source. Sa résolution exige un WorldObjectRecord situé dans un fournisseur et un monde ; une égalité textuelle seule ne crée aucune identité d’objet."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expectedWorldObject|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the source explicitly supplies this relation and its context."
msgstr "Utiliser lorsque la source fournit explicitement cette relation et son contexte."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expectedWorldObject|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inventing missing source bindings or inferring execution and success from this record alone."
msgstr "Éviter d’inventer des liens source absents ou de déduire exécution et réussite de ce seul enregistrement."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expectedWorldObject|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep the supplied xsd:string or xsd:token identifier on ConditionVerifier with its source attribution. Retain provider-and-world context and any separately established object resolution."
msgstr "Conserver l’identifiant xsd:string ou xsd:token fourni sur ConditionVerifier avec son attribution de source. Garder le contexte de fournisseur et de monde ainsi que toute résolution d’objet établie séparément."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expectedWorldObject|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Preserve the supplied lexical form and datatype: verbatim xsd:string and explicitly supplied xsd:token are admitted. Do not normalize whitespace, retype a string or infer token typing. These declarations do not install a token lexical checker. Matching unresolved spelling does not identify objects across providers or worlds."
msgstr "Préserver la forme lexicale et le type de données fournis : les xsd:string verbatim et les xsd:token explicitement fournis sont admis. Ne pas normaliser les espaces, changer le type d’une chaîne ni déduire un type token. Ces déclarations n’installent aucun vérificateur lexical de token. Une même graphie non résolue n’identifie pas des objets entre fournisseurs ou mondes différents."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expectedWorldObject|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:record gmeow:expectedWorldObject \"source-value\" ."
msgstr "ex:record gmeow:expectedWorldObject \"source-value\" ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierArtifactExists|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "artifact exists verifier"
msgstr "vérification d’existence d’artefact"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierArtifactExists|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Verification requiring an actual cited artifact observation and identified artifact. A configured title or a successful tool invocation alone does not establish artifact existence."
msgstr "Vérification exigeant une observation réelle d’artefact citée et un artefact identifié. Un titre configuré ou une invocation d’outil réussie ne suffit pas à établir son existence."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierArtifactExists|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the source explicitly selects this verification method."
msgstr "Utiliser lorsque la source choisit explicitement cette méthode de vérification."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierArtifactExists|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inventing missing source bindings or inferring execution and success from this record alone."
msgstr "Éviter d’inventer des liens source absents ou de déduire exécution et réussite de ce seul enregistrement."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierArtifactExists|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain actual source values, identities and attribution; preserve supplied wording, language and direction."
msgstr "Conserver valeurs, identités et attribution réelles de la source ; préserver formulation, langue et direction fournies."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierArtifactExists|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Source evidence and configuration remain distinct. Competing attributed records may coexist without a preferred claim."
msgstr "Les preuves source et la configuration restent distinctes. Des enregistrements attribués concurrents peuvent coexister sans déclaration privilégiée."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierArtifactExists|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:descriptor gmeow:conditionVerifierKind gmeow:verifierArtifactExists ."
msgstr "ex:descriptor gmeow:conditionVerifierKind gmeow:verifierArtifactExists ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierExternalObservation|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "external observation verifier"
msgstr "vérification par observation externe"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierExternalObservation|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Verification requiring a cited held observation with its actual vantage and the expected statement binding. Expected text and an uncited summary are not external observation evidence."
msgstr "Vérification exigeant une observation citée et tenue pour vraie, avec son point de vue réel et le lien vers l’énoncé attendu. Texte attendu et résumé sans citation ne sont pas des preuves d’observation externe."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierExternalObservation|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the source explicitly selects this verification method."
msgstr "Utiliser lorsque la source choisit explicitement cette méthode de vérification."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierExternalObservation|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inventing missing source bindings or inferring execution and success from this record alone."
msgstr "Éviter d’inventer des liens source absents ou de déduire exécution et réussite de ce seul enregistrement."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierExternalObservation|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain actual source values, identities and attribution; preserve supplied wording, language and direction."
msgstr "Conserver valeurs, identités et attribution réelles de la source ; préserver formulation, langue et direction fournies."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierExternalObservation|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Source evidence and configuration remain distinct. Competing attributed records may coexist without a preferred claim."
msgstr "Les preuves source et la configuration restent distinctes. Des enregistrements attribués concurrents peuvent coexister sans déclaration privilégiée."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verifierExternalObservation|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
