msgstr "ex:record gmeow:nextAction \"source-value\" ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/intentionEventSequence|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "intention event sequence"
msgstr "numéro d’événement d’intention"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/intentionEventSequence|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The writer's original nonnegative event numbering within an actual intention and source context. The exact statement is attributed to its actual writer; numbering need not be zero-based and is never inferred from clocks."
msgstr "Numérotation originale non négative des événements par le rédacteur, pour une intention et un contexte source réels. L’énoncé exact est attribué au rédacteur réel ; elle peut commencer ailleurs qu’à zéro et ne se déduit jamais des horloges."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/intentionEventSequence|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the source explicitly supplies this relation and its context."
msgstr "Utiliser lorsque la source fournit explicitement cette relation et son contexte."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/intentionEventSequence|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inventing missing source bindings or inferring execution and success from this record alone."
msgstr "Éviter d’inventer des liens source absents ou de déduire exécution et réussite de ce seul enregistrement."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/intentionEventSequence|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain actual source values, identities and attribution; preserve supplied wording, language and direction."
msgstr "Conserver valeurs, identités et attribution réelles de la source ; préserver formulation, langue et direction fournies."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/intentionEventSequence|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Source evidence and configuration remain distinct. Competing attributed records may coexist without a preferred claim."
msgstr "Les preuves source et la configuration restent distinctes. Des enregistrements attribués concurrents peuvent coexister sans déclaration privilégiée."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/intentionEventSequence|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:record gmeow:intentionEventSequence \"1\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ."
msgstr "ex:record gmeow:intentionEventSequence \"1\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/deadlineAt|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "deadline at"
msgstr "échéance à"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/deadlineAt|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The source-stated deadline instant of an intention. Preserve supplied precision, timezone and temporal frame; no date, timezone or deadline completion is inferred from missing fields."
msgstr "Instant d’échéance d’une intention indiqué par la source. Conserver précision, fuseau et cadre temporel fournis ; aucun champ absent ne justifie d’inventer une date, un fuseau ou une réalisation."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/deadlineAt|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the source explicitly supplies this relation and its context."
msgstr "Utiliser lorsque la source fournit explicitement cette relation et son contexte."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/deadlineAt|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
