msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ReleasedIntentionTenureConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A release reason belongs to a tenure whose actual interval has an explicit end instant or end timestamp; the reason never fabricates closure."
